<tr data-local-id=3D"489ccf553a7e">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#eae6ff" data-local-id=3D"5c98be3f4411" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"13627f42bfa3"><strong>The SGS Second Opinion queue </strong>=
 This queue in Zendesk lets the agents escalate cases to their Tier 1 Team =
leads</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#eae6ff" data-local-id=3D"415ffed717ce" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"aa1146bca77b">
<li local-id=3D"8d8fb55991ec">
<p local-id=3D"4eb0802dbeed"><strong>Knowledge Base Gap:</strong> Whenever =
the solution to a specific issue <strong>cannot</strong> be found in the cu=
rrent Knowledge Base (KB). This includes highly complex situations/edge cas=
es where the KB may not have an exact example or guideline.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"98e59231-ee58-4a39-883d-5e011aa6c284">
<p local-id=3D"c7ac14027585"><strong>General Inquiries:</strong> Whenever t=
he issue is not explicitly listed as a direct escalation to Tier 2&nbsp; on=
 the<a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ASK/pages/3000=
90383/6c.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams" data-linked-resource-id=3D"300090383"=
 data-linked-resource-version=3D"107" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"> <=
u>Escalations to Other Teams</u></a> page.</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#eae6ff" data-local-id=3D"7b2c3d5f1aff" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"03c156fc858d">
<li local-id=3D"13ed7c824c33">
<p local-id=3D"497e7ea37b05"><strong>Documentation:</strong> You have clear=
ly stated what you have already checked and your comment is complete</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"aeb1da3f9fe4">
<p local-id=3D"3831f9c59081"><strong>Specific Question:</strong> You have i=
ncluded a note explaining exactly what part of the process requires a secon=
d opinion.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"01a9ec27a068">
<p local-id=3D"9bf10b4e16e2"><strong>Resolution (When possible):</strong> Y=
ou include your proposed resolution/action in your comment.</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#eae6ff" data-local-id=3D"01f9a9acecee" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8edf1c935b18"></p></td>
