 Reassign Tickets</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"9b13dc817d60" id=3D"id-6a.FraudSupportInternalEscalations-E=
scalatingaTickettoSGSSecondOpinion"><img class=3D"emoticon emoticon-arrow-u=
p" data-emoji-id=3D"2b06" data-emoji-shortname=3D":arrow_up:" data-emoji-fa=
llback=3D"=E2=AC=86=EF=B8=8F" src=3D"c592e8aadeca3b5cc41b2a0e13b390a0d8fef5=
af3ef447170004a1bfd0d1cc64" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" data-emoticon-name=
=3D"arrow-up" alt=3D"content.emoticon.arrow-up"> Escalating a Ticket to SGS=
 Second Opinion</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2f97e8405931">To escalate a ticket to the SGS Second Opinion=
 view, agents should follow these steps:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"bb3cb8834ac7">
<li local-id=3D"1d4d6d7ed3c0">
<p local-id=3D"35c998915350">Apply the =E2=80=9C<strong>Escalate/Transfer::=
To SGS Second Opinion</strong>=E2=80=9D macro.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a7b6731f4ada">
<p local-id=3D"5d81e506d5ac">Fill in all relevant information for the inter=
nal comment.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"83081215ee23" id=3D"id-6a.FraudSupportInternalEscalations-R=
eassigningaTicketBacktotheOriginalAgent"><img class=3D"emoticon emoticon-bl=
ue-star" data-emoji-id=3D"2194" data-emoji-shortname=3D":left_right_arrow:"=
 data-emoji-fallback=3D"=E2=86=94=EF=B8=8F" src=3D"be2282db454d8e8b635fc990=
0e9957d7ff0960aa9786539f9b6c9cbf3554dee5" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" data-e=
moticon-name=3D"blue-star" alt=3D"(blue star)"> Reassigning a Ticket Back t=
o the Original Agent</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f916c4a14215">After support processes the escalation, reassi=
gn the ticket back to the original agent by following these steps:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d908fa6f84b0">
<li local-id=3D"559041ada643">
<p local-id=3D"0b8cf22196f9">Assign the ticket back to the agent via the =
=E2=80=9CAssignee=E2=80=9D dropdown menu.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b94cc36ce436">
<p local-id=3D"30d699b7520c">Select the Fraud Support Group.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6c1df2b8ff24">
<p local-id=3D"4749e5284478">Select the agent who originally escalated the =
ticket.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2eea88933c9a">
<p local-id=3D"cbe72153d948">Scroll down on the left side panel to <strong>=
un-check</strong> the =E2=80=9CEscalate to SGS Second Opinion=E2=80=9D box =
shown below.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a8dde16e780">
<p local-id=3D"1fd95412726a">After taking both of these steps, please submi=
t the ticket as Open.</p></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"219" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"dbb939af32312e461cadd559172365ae39ae4e363a207fdd306cc848f43b4a0f" data-=
image-src=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/19=
83971550/Screenshot%202026-05-07%20at%202.28.01%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=3D1&=
amp;modificationDate=3D1778178533892&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" dat=
a-height=3D"287" data-width=3D"225" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" dat=
a-linked-resource-id=3D"1983873948" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data=
-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"=
Screenshot 2026-05-07 at 2.28.01=E2=80=AFPM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://t=
ripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/p=
ng" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1983971550" data-linked-resource-c=
ontainer-version=3D"22" data-media-id=3D"41eb1a4c-b97e-4a76-9a19-95172d779a=
1e" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"279"></span>
<h3 local-id=3D"1009942c2f4e" id=3D"id-6a.FraudSupportInternalEscalations-E=
scalatingaTickettoTier2">Escalating a Ticket to Tier 2</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ec5dc9f89d48">To escalate a ticket to Tier 2, agents should =
follow these steps:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1c338519-4fbc-4c3f-b044-2571618a9c9e">
<li local-id=3D"822601aa-4bab-414b-88f6-476dc2ccde5c">
<p local-id=3D"18ba8c712bdf">Apply the =E2=80=9C<strong>To FS Tier 2</stron=
g>=E2=80=9D macro.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1598b19-d48e-46b9-bed8-31175cde998c">
<p local-id=3D"035977afc78d">Fill in all relevant information for the inter=
nal comment.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"813523d3ce11"></p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<h3 local-id=3D"96f4820c94cf" id=3D"id-6a.FraudSupportInternalEscalations-O=
verviewforTeamLeads"><strong>Overview for Team Leads</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"5e0576d75f22"><strong>Team Leads</strong> are responsible fo=
r monitoring and processing all tickets within the <strong>SGS Second Opini=
on</strong> <strong>queue</strong>. The primary goal is to provide timely g=
uidance to agents and maintain high quality standards across the team.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e47b4816d23">Tickets escalated to this queue should be proc=
essed within <strong>72 hours</strong> to avoid delays in responses to end =
users.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"dfa15f8e64b4"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
